{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-highlife-collection-spas-6-fin-rotary-jet-in-a-spa-2602-0252","content_id":"8a2e4a92-11ef-4b72-adf3-b43c32451376","description":"Product Safety Report for Highlife Collection Spas 6-fin Rotary Jet in a Spa presenting a risk of drowning. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7f29ec8c-aace-4547-9af4-6e6cb1093afd","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-06T14:08:20+00:00","id":"7f29ec8c-aace-4547-9af4-6e6cb1093afd","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-06T14:08:20+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aadfd4c78869bf8eb8a49d/2602-0252-product-safety-report-watkins-6-fin-rotary-jet.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Highlife Collection Spas 6-fin Rotary Jet in a Spa</p>\n\n<p>Hazard:  The Highlife Collection Spas 6fin rotary jet presents a risk of drowning because it may cause a suction, which in turn may cause hair entanglement and drowning.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product is subject to a modification programme.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical Appliances and Equipment – Hot Tub</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Spa Models</td>\n      <td>Highlife Collection spa models: Grandee, Envoy, Vanguard, Aria, Prodigy, Sovereign, Jetsetter, and Jetsetter LX </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Spa Model Years</td>\n      <td>2023, 2024, 2025 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rotary Jet Part Number</td>\n      <td>1883501-01 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Serial numbers</td>\n      <td>Please see Annex A in the linked PDF for serial numbers, spa configurations and instructions on safe removal/replacement of jets.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Hot tub jet that moves in a circular motion to create a massage effect.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7f29ec8c-aace-4547-9af4-6e6cb1093afd\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69aadfd4c78869bf8eb8a49d/2602-0252-product-safety-report-watkins-6-fin-rotary-jet.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product with the 6fin rotary jet concerned presents a risk of drowning because the rotary jet may cause a suction, which in turn may cause hair entanglement and entrapment. This may lead to the user becoming submerged underwater, and drowning.  </p>\n\n<p>The 6fin rotary jet does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product is subject to a modification programme. The manufacturer \nhas stopped sales of the 6fin rotary jet and advised end users (via distributors) to switch off the 6fin rotary jets. End users are encouraged to register with their distributor for a replacement rotary jet. For more information, please contact:  <a href=\"mailto:eujetrecall@watkinsmfg.com\">eujetrecall@watkinsmfg.com</a> or please see Annex A in the linked PDF, provided by the manufacturer.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0252</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-06T14:10:16Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-06","product_risk_level":"low"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-06T14:10:16+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-highlife-collection-spas-6-fin-rotary-jet-in-a-spa-2602-0252","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-highlife-collection-spas-6-fin-rotary-jet-in-a-spa-2602-0252","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-highlife-collection-spas-6-fin-rotary-jet-in-a-spa-2602-0252","content_id":"8a2e4a92-11ef-4b72-adf3-b43c32451376","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-06T14:10:16Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Highlife Collection Spas 6-fin Rotary Jet in a Spa (2602-0252)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-highlife-collection-spas-6-fin-rotary-jet-in-a-spa-2602-0252","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of t